# Ignore everything
*

# Except these
!.gitignore
!AGENTS.md
!LICENSE
!README.md

# Skills are published one at a time, on purpose. This repo is PUBLIC, and skills
# are where machine paths, cluster hostnames and private-project internals collect.
# `!skills/*/` only lets git descend into the skill dirs - git does not track empty
# directories, so a skill stays local until it gets its own `!skills/<name>/**` line.
!skills/
!skills/*/

!skills/audit/**
!skills/doublecheck/**
!skills/handoff/**
!skills/hpc/**
!skills/plan/**
!skills/task/**
!skills/triage/**
